xclass=\"ORD\"><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> Let <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{R}_i(\\boldsymbol{\\upalpha})\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛂</mjx-utext></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> be a\n<strong>working correlation matrix</strong>: a correlation matrix for\nthe <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"n_i\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D456 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-scr